s=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features many social features such as Proximity Voice Chat and Trading inorder to enhance the multiplayer experience.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future Updates:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Character Creation Options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modding Support (We love modders and would love to see servers be able to make their own mods to enhance the experience)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Now!</p>",
